for the "keeping track of presence" side of things, my suggestion would be something like below:

* "presence sharing" list which explicitly says which MXID can see your presence. This is also processed by the server in order to determine which homeservers to send these EDUs to
* "presence subscription" list which is in account data. Contains all known subscriptions but only act as a suggestive approach

