kim i have a question wrt msc4325. suppose i have the `m.presence_sharing_config` of the following:

```json
{
    "allowed_users": [
        "@*:matrix.org",
    ],
    "denied_users": [
        "@bob:matrix.org"
    ]
}
```

then how could the homeserver create a list in such a way that it "send to anybody on matrix.org except for Bob"?

